13
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:28.535
<v Maya>Handed them over.</v>

14
00:01:29.272 --> 00:01:44.119
<v Daniel>Yep. And the core mission of our discussion today, the real tension here, is exploring what happens next. Like what happens when an artificial intelligence claims to generate mathematical proofs at a volume and a speed that is far, far greater than the entire human</v>

