60
00:06:02.623 --> 00:06:17.575
<v Daniel>But if you want to get closer and closer to the true value of pi, you have to use fractions with larger and larger numbers on the top and bottom. The irrationality exponent essentially measures how incredibly massive those numbers have to get to buy</v>

